{
  "about": "Hand-kept locale data that www's sitemap dataset (tools/source-export/feeds/sitemaps/roots.json) does not have. tools/markets/build-locale-table.mjs joins both into scripts/locale-table.js. status: live (on Edge Delivery: the site treats it as migrated) or pilot (rendered with its own row, links to it still go to www). shopLang null: the shop handoff's default (en-GB).",
